### Login de usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login con credenciales inválidas
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario_inexistente",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login sin username (validación)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login sin password (validación)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin"
}

### Registro de nuevo usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "email": "adminadmin@example.com",
  "fullName": "admin"
}

### Registro con username existente (error)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "otro@example.com",
  "fullName": "Otro Usuario"
}

### Registro con email existente (error)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "otro_usuario",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "fullName": "Otro Usuario"
}

### Registro sin campos obligatorios (validación)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario_incompleto",
  "password": "123"
}

### Validar token JWT (reemplazar TOKEN_AQUI con el token recibido del login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Validar token sin Bearer (error)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/validate
Authorization: TOKEN_AQUI

### Validar sin header de autorización (error)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/validate
